@Palette.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7101
@ClerkSessionToken = replace-with-a-valid-clerk-session-token

### Check API connectivity
GET {{Palette.Api_HostAddress}}/api/test
Accept: application/json

### Synchronize the authenticated user's profile
PUT {{Palette.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{ClerkSessionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "palette-user",
  "email": "user@example.com"
}

### Read the authenticated user's profile
GET {{Palette.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{ClerkSessionToken}}
